The GNU Radio flowgraph in this directory (dandiq_rx.grc) is derived from the
learnSDR course material by Jason Gallicchio — specifically the QPSK modem of
lesson 20, "Resolving the Phase Ambiguity and Differential Encoding".

    https://gallicchio.github.io/learnSDR/
    https://github.com/gallicchio/learnSDR

The original is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in full below.
Modifications for the Dand-IQ link were made by Talha Telli and are released
under the MIT License of this repository (see ../LICENSE).

